      "properties": {
        "snippet": "Future Connect is Auckland’s strategic, multi‑modal network identifying the most important corridors for people and freight movement across Tāmaki Makaurau. This layer integrates the core Strategic Networks for public transport, general traffic, freight, and cycling. \n\nIt represents the long‑term vision for Auckland’s network (2026–2036) and highlights priority routes.",
