        "access": "public",
        "description": "<p>This open data is provided for reference. The primary and recommended way to view Future Connect, with additional Transport System Analysis and other insights (not shared as open data), is through the <a target='_blank' href='https://mahere.at.govt.nz/FutureConnect/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Future Connect Mapping Portal</a>.</p><h2>Description</h2><p>The <strong>Future Connect Integrated Network </strong>layer represents a long-term, multi-modal view of the region’s most important transport corridors and connections. Comprised of both the <strong>Current </strong>(existing) and <strong>First Decade</strong> (longer-term) views of Auckland’s transport network, it brings together the <strong>Strategic Networks</strong> for all transport modes — public transport, general traffic, freight, and cycling — into a single, cohesive spatial dataset. This layer also includes the lower order, <strong>Supporting Network</strong> links for all modes.</p><figure><table border='1'><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th><strong>Strategic Networks</strong></th><th><strong>Supporting Networks</strong></th></tr><tbody><tr><td>Public Transport</td><td>Rapid Transit<br />Interim Rapid Transit<br />Frequent Transit<br />Other Strategic Corridors</td><td>Connector<br />Local<br />Peak<br />Rural Township</td></tr><tr><td>Cycle and Micromobility</td><td>Regional<br />Major<br />Connector</td><td>Local<br />Leisure<br />Sport</td></tr><tr><td>General Traffic</td><td>Motorway<br />Strategic<br />Primary<br />Secondary</td><td>Collector<br />Local</td></tr><tr><td>Freight</td><td>Rail<br />Level 1A<br />Level 1B<br />Level 2<br />Level 3</td><td>Access<br />Ferry</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><strong>Intended Use</strong></p><ul><li>Transport planning and prioritisation</li><li>Identifying key corridors for operational management</li><li>Supporting RLTP investment decisions</li><li>Land‑use and development integration</li></ul><p><strong>Limitations</strong></p><ul><li>Does <i>not</i> define or commit to specific projects.</li><li>Not a detailed engineering or operational dataset.</li><li>Represents strategic priorities at a regional scale.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>For more information, visit <a target='_blank' href='https://www.at.govt.nz/futureconnect' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AT.govt.nz/FutureConnect</a>.</p>",
        "licenseInfo": "<p><a target='_blank' href='https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>CC BY</a></p>",
